  "description": "\"This can't be happening. Let me out!\"  \nA young man happens upon a mysterious house in the woods and is chosen as its warden. Much to his horror, however, he learns that he is forever trapped inside, and the only way to be free is to lure in a replacement-an impossible feat that must be accomplished from within the confines of the house. (Manta)\n\n[Official English](https://manta.net/series/1927)",
